{"signature": "4d987d5e91fae64f321cc650df8fff49a25e5ed8eab0fa8cd678f92ec74f3b20", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "gslides", "file": "data.json", "pointer": "/slides_presentations", "field": "presentation_id", "values": ["f_02ebfaf11d3f622b57e9bb", "f_05333fa94c2a648263dc90", "f_10de61ca7886bb1e5f3fe1", "f_196bb1ecd0a910067d1a39", "f_7af8adc573c08cc8334651", "f_a56ca06dbec08ebc919adb", "f_e37f1de047a1b1e5156607", "f_e5d882de8e80f1ea5839cc", "f_ffd7fdb72db51775ff6d67"]}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/gslides/data.json", "pointer": "/slides_presentations/1", "field": "presentation_id", "value": "f_02ebfaf11d3f622b57e9bb", "record": {"presentation_id": "f_02ebfaf11d3f622b57e9bb", "title": "Domino Delights Design Post Mortem", "owner_email": "julia.lawson@harmonygames.co", "shared_with_emails": ["brian.foster@harmonygames.co"], "visibility": "private", "pages": [{"object_id": "slide_d343910f6f6e", "index": 0, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_5230587fdbd5", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "Why developers\nno follow doc?", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_a9c892d6f71e", "index": 1, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_52e6fdea2f60", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "What we asked them?\n\n2\n\nDo you think the design documents are\nadequate?\n01\nIf you could change one thing about the\n02 documents what would that be?\nIf you were making these documents, what\n03 would you do differently.\n04\n\nDo you have any general feedback for the\ndesign team? What could we improve or do\nbetter?\nHow do you think the communication between\n\n05\n\nmultiple engineers and the designer be?\n\nWhat's your general workflow and do you think it\n06 should be standardized in any way?\n07\n\nWhy do you think delays happen?", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_bee64ce651fb", "index": 2, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_185c2d13beb4", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "OVERVIEW\n\n3\n\nThe engineering team are\noverall very happy with us.\nThey find the design team\nkind, helpful and\ncommunicative.\nDOCUMENT\n\nCOMMUNICATION\n\nIMPROVEMENT\n\nAll engineers find the\ndocuments to be sufficient and\nthe language understandable.\nBut they want more visual\ninstructions.\n\nThey admit to not always\nfollowing the channels because\nthey find it noisy. They want\nchannels to have general\ndiscussion and solve everything\nelse in smaller groups or 1-1.\n\nThey want us to spend more\ntime writing and designing so\nthat we can detect edger cases\nearly on.", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_e506fd4ad350", "index": 3, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_8685c75f9adc", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "DELAYS THOUGH\n\n4\n\nthink things are\n\nEngineers\n\nmoving quite fast!\nASSET BANK\nThey appreciate SAMUEL?s UI\n\nimplementation a lot! They\nwant to spend less time\nimporting and more time\ncoding.\n\nGOOD DESIGN PILLARS\nThey want better architecture\nstarting from the document.\nWhen specs are not tied to a\n[USERNAME_4231],\n\nare a lot of\n\nIDs and classes and not\neveryone knows they exist.\n\nCONSTANT FEEDBACK AND DESIGN\nSTABILITY\n\nThey want things to be designed once and not iterated later. They want\nthe finalized design to be checked every time There\n\nis progress on a\n\nbranch/video/build and give constant feedback that things are going okay.", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_9667e6738819", "index": 4, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_559b7758423f", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "ACTION ITEMS\nMore visuals and more\naccountability.\n1. ADD WIREFRAMES TO FLOW\n2. ASK Developer\n\nTO VET THE\n\nDOCUMENT AND HOLD\nACCOUNTABLE\n3. DIVIDE SUBTASKS, ASK FOR\nPROVESS AND CHECK DAILY\n4. TRY CREATE NON-PARALLEL BACK\nEND work\n\n(LOL)\n\n5", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_ddcce7132168", "index": 5, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_70c4c52f72fb", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "Thank You\nWe have arrived at the part\nwhere we all understand what\u2019s\ngoing on but engage\n\nin\n\nconversation to be polite.\n\n6", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}], "drive_file_id": "f_02ebfaf11d3f622b57e9bb", "revision_id": "93dbb60710", "created_time": "2025-03-25T15:55:42Z", "modified_time": "2025-03-25T16:31:51Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/gslides/data.json", "pointer": "/slides_presentations/3", "field": "presentation_id", "value": "f_05333fa94c2a648263dc90", "record": {"presentation_id": "f_05333fa94c2a648263dc90", "title": "Hybridcasual Ideation Template - Copy File Before_", "owner_email": "julia.lawson@harmonygames.co", "shared_with_emails": [], "visibility": "private", "pages": [{"object_id": "slide_cf82ac159869", "index": 0, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_1151940de2ca", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "GAME NAME IDEA AND DATE", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_e3bfe9491e78", "index": 1, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_ec94ee27a0ca", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "Make sure you?re merging 2 trends. 3 if absolutely necessary. Trends can come from games, TV shows, social\n\nmedia, etc. Put nice videos\n\nand visuals of the trends and make sure your new game mockup doesn\u2019t pale in comparison. Don\u2019t use simple shapes, jazz it up with AI.\n\nTREND\n#1\n\nAdd notes if any\n\nTREND\n#2\n\nTREND\n#3\n\nAdd notes if any\n\nAdd notes if any\n\nNEW GAME\n\nWrite core loop in\none simple\nsentence", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_e4cbbe5b47d4", "index": 2, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_cfc020664663", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "CORE GAME\nExplain your core loop here using the graph elements on the\nright. Place your core game mock from page 1 here and show\ncore game elements in placement if you have the time to go\nthe extra mile.", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_bd2a23412a31", "index": 3, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_7efa8f285da8", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "GAMEPLAY MOCK\nUPS\n\nOne mockup per gameplay mechanic. For example, one for progression, one for obstacles, one for win condition, one for fail condition\netc. Whatever you think has the most potential to highlight the USP of the game.", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_593a8a77102f", "index": 4, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_901df6b8bf02", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "GAMEPLAY\nIf you have a unique input or visual cue, make sure to have visual reference. Don\u2019t\nstress about filling in every section for every game. Some ideas are better off without\nover explaining a weak or obvious point.\nInput\n\nTap, swipe, two hand, tap and hold, draw,\netc.\n\nengagement\n\nPut all your dopamine and retention\nhooks that you think are relevant here.\nThe more crowded the better.\n\nUnique selling point\nWhy your game stands out despite\nmixing two well known things together?\nWhy did merge two things but emerged\nas a totally unique thing?", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_11e2ac8d091d", "index": 5, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_45e082c1d0fb", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "GAMEPLAY\nIf you have a unique input or visual cue, make sure to have visual reference. Don\u2019t\nstress about filling in every section for every game. Some ideas are better off without\nover explaining a weak or obvious point.\nTarget Audience\n\nThe more generic the\nbetter.\n\nScaling Strategy\nWhat are your plans once the PM informs\nyou that you passed the initial CPI and\nretention test?\n\nMonetization Hooks\nWhy will players pay you to continue\nplaying your game?", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_46ee029b89c7", "index": 6, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_5c168ba9f050", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "ART STYLE\nOptional. Turn this slide into a Pinterest\n\nor art style.\n\nboard if your game idea requires a specific visual allure", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}], "drive_file_id": "f_05333fa94c2a648263dc90", "revision_id": "6fccfbf411", "created_time": "2025-10-27T19:38:04Z", "modified_time": "2025-10-28T18:17:27Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/gslides/data.json", "pointer": "/slides_presentations/12", "field": "presentation_id", "value": "f_10de61ca7886bb1e5f3fe1", "record": {"presentation_id": "f_10de61ca7886bb1e5f3fe1", "title": "Barbie Dream Life Glow", "owner_email": "julia.lawson@harmonygames.co", "shared_with_emails": [], "visibility": "domain", "pages": [{"object_id": "slide_14b9a01ea684", "index": 0, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_33f4b83774c4", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "Dream Life\n[USERNAM\nE_41778]\n\nAn idle life simulation for\nBarbie\n\ngirls of all ages", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_d3373c012fc9", "index": 1, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_ee06016dc205", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "[USERNAME_3879\n2]\nBarbie\n\nset in the Barbie\nBarbie\n\n: Dream Life Glow is a full-scale idle life simulation\nLand universe. Players design their own\nfrom the ground up with vast and inclusive\n\noptions.\nAt its heart, the game celebrates the timeless Barbie\n\nmessage: you can be anything you want \u2014 and look\nfabulous doing it.", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_8e7f77797e16", "index": 2, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_5f3857eb4072", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "Build Your Dream\nLife\nChoose Your Profession\nStart your journey by choosing who you want to\nbe. Become a doctor, singer, baker\n\n, or fashion\n\nicon \u2014 or try them all! Each career unlocks\nunique stories, outfits, and mini-games as you\nclimb the ladder toward your dream life.\nBuild Your Dream House\nDesign, decorate, and upgrade your own\nDreamhouse from a cozy studio apartment to a\n\nglamorous mansion. Collect furniture, unlock\n\nthemed rooms, and customize every detail to\nreflect your style and success.\nSocialize in Real Time\nMeet friends and connect in Barbie\n\nLand?s\n\nshared spaces ? coffee shops, bakeries, salons,\n\nand parks. Chat, hang out, and celebrate\nachievements together in real time as your\nBarbies build their glow-up journeys side by side.", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_87a7d560bb4d", "index": 3, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_028c3179dcdb", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "Evergreen content with seasonal\n[USERNA\nME_2501]\nBarbie\n\n: Dream Life Glow introduces\n\nlimited-time seasonal looks inspired\nby real Barbie Signature\n\ncollections\n\n\u2014 connecting fashion, culture, and\ncreativity.\nEach event brings new collectible\noutfits, themed d\u00e9cor, and\ncommunity challenges that\ncelebrate iconic moments like D\u00eda\nde Muertos, Lunar New Year, or Met\n\nGala Season.\n\nReal product\n\nIn-game\n\nPlayers can express themselves,\ncollect exclusive items, and join\nglobal celebrations \u2014 keeping\nBarbie\n\nLAND ever-evolving and\n\nvibrant all year round.", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_3c3c8b0f8e6a", "index": 4, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_a2e994fab8f4", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "Narrative Driven social\n[LOCATION_2\n803]\nBarbie\n\n: Dream Life Glow transforms\n\nlife simulation into a story-driven\nsocial\n\nPlayers\n\nexperience.\n\ndon?t just decorate and\n\ndress up, they live in an evolving\nworld filled with meaningful\ninteractions and personal growth.\nNavigate a connected world of\ninteractive hubs from cozy caf\u00e9s\nand chic bakeries to glamorous\nrunways. Each location hosts mini-\n\nstories, activities, and collectible\nrewards.", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_d68a4ccd336e", "index": 5, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_16ceea2105f2", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "Multiple Core Loops\nLayered gameplay prevents fatigue and inflation by giving each loop a unique motivation and reward rhythm. Players\nswitch between fast-paced, creative, and social\n\nactivities, keeping engagement\n\nfresh, goals diversified, and Barbie\n\nLand alive.\n\nDaily\nLoop\n\u2605\n\nSend Barbie\n\nLifestyle\nLoop\nto work\n\nin her\n\nchosen career ([PERSON_NAME_18701], Singer\n\n,\n\n\u2605\n\nEnergy automatically over time.\n\u2605\n\n\u2605\n\nTap at key moments to trigger\nmini interactions and bonus\nrewards.\nUse earnings to upgrade\nworkspaces and unlock highertier professions.\n\n0404]\n\nLoop\n\nSpend earned resources to\n\n\u2605\n\nExplore shared social\n\nhubs\n\ndecorate [PERSON_NAME_1302]?s Dreamhouse,\n\n[PERSON_NAME_5302], etc.)\n\n\u2605\n\n[PERSON_NAME_\n\nstyle outfits, and accessorize.\n\u2605\n\nUnlock exclusive fashion and\nd\u00e9cor sets through career\nmilestones and seasonal events.\n\n\u2605\n\nInteract with other players\u2019\nBarbies through emotes, chats,\nand co-op tasks.\n\n\u2605\n\nShowcase your Barbie\n\n?s look and\n\n\u2605\n\nlifestyle across the social\n\nworld.\n\nParticipate in story-driven events\nand limited-time celebrations\n(e.g. D\u00eda de Muertos).\n\n\u2605\n\nUnlock new cosmetics, narrative\n\n\u2605\n\nReceive likes, compliments, or\nrewards from other players.\n\narcs, and relationship levels.", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_f5981f6d8e08", "index": 6, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_6f59d306f175", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "Interconnected\nInstead of relying on a single soft currency, Barbie\n\n: Dream Life Glow features a multi-layered economy where each\n\nloop feeds into the others \u2014 encouraging balanced play and cross-progression.\n\nIdle Layer\n\nCurrency\n\u2605\n\nCareer coins drive idle\nprogression and daily logins.\n\n\u2605\n\nEarned automatically while\nBarbie\n\nworks in her profession.\n\nCustomization\nTokens\n\nSeasonal\nTickets\n\n\u2605\n\nLifestyle tokens bridge\nbetween career progress and\npersonal expression.\n\n\u2605\n\nsocial\n\n\u2605\n\nGained through achievements,\n\n\u2605\n\nEarned via social\n\n\u2605\n\nUsed to upgrade workstations,\nboost productivity, and unlock\nnew job tiers.\nConverts partially into Lifestyle\nTokens through daily\nachievements.\n\nactivities,\n\nbrunch events, or mini-games.\n\nidle milestones, and social\n\n\u2605\n\nsustain\nexcitement through rotating\nthemes and live-ops.\ntickets\n\npraise.\n\u2605\n\nSpent on fashion, d\u00e9cor, and\nDreamhouse upgrades.\n\n\u2605\n\nCan be exchanged for Event\nTickets during seasonal updates.\n\n\u2605\n\nUsed for exclusive outfits,\nfurniture sets, and limited-edition\ncosmetics.\n\n\u2605\n\nCreates short-term goals and\nreasons to re-engage\n\n.", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_fdf8f52677e7", "index": 7, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_c82acaa0af7e", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "The\nGameplay", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_dc72239d69d8", "index": 8, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_faf9eb862693", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "Why It Works?\n\nSimulation is a Proven\n\naudience fit\n\nIdle Clicker\n\nis a Proven\n\nmonetization fit", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_8818fec7b559", "index": 9, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_93096e04df79", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "Innovative\nMonetization", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}], "drive_file_id": "f_10de61ca7886bb1e5f3fe1", "revision_id": "30b20d25df", "created_time": "2025-11-03T11:52:10Z", "modified_time": "2025-11-13T16:30:17Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/gslides/data.json", "pointer": "/slides_presentations/19", "field": "presentation_id", "value": "f_196bb1ecd0a910067d1a39", "record": {"presentation_id": "f_196bb1ecd0a910067d1a39", "title": "SIGILBOUND", "owner_email": "julia.lawson@harmonygames.co", "shared_with_emails": [], "visibility": "domain", "pages": [{"object_id": "slide_311b90e5525a", "index": 0, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_d633d8a48075", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "[USERNAME_9718]\n\n(cover and and logo with a nice\nfont)", "placeholder_type": null, "x_emu": 0, "y_emu": 0, "width_emu": 9144000, "height_emu": 5143500}]}, {"object_id": "slide_841ef5f5850a", "index": 1, "layout": "BLANK", "elements": [{"object_id": "el_2410be49b6f7", "kind": "TEXT_BOX", "text": "The Story\n[